  "bug_info": "Summary of configuration for Project: Math\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Script dir: /root/defects4j/framework\n      Base dir: /root/defects4j\n    Major root: /root/defects4j/major\n      Repo dir: /root/defects4j/project_repos\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Project ID: Math\n       Program: commons-math\n    Build file: /root/defects4j/framework/projects/Math/Math.build.xml\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n           Vcs: Vcs::Git\n    Repository: /root/defects4j/project_repos/commons-math.git\n     Commit db: /root/defects4j/framework/projects/Math/active-bugs.csv\nNumber of bugs: 106\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSummary for Bug: Math-4\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRevision ID (fixed version):\nd270055e874148a2742604be36ab977eec030fba\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRevision date (fixed version):\n2013-06-03 07:15:00 +0000\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBug report id:\nMATH-988\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBug report url:\nhttps://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MATH-988\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nRoot cause in triggering tests:\n - org.apache.commons.math3.geometry.euclidean.threed.SubLineTest::testIntersectionNotIntersecting\n   --> java.lang.NullPointerException\n - org.apache.commons.math3.geometry.euclidean.twod.SubLineTest::testIntersectionParallel\n   --> java.lang.NullPointerException\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nList of modified sources:\n - org.apache.commons.math3.geometry.euclidean.threed.SubLine\n - org.apache.commons.math3.geometry.euclidean.twod.SubLine\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
  "bug_report_content": "Title: NPE when calling SubLine.intersection() with non-intersecting lines\nType: Bug | Priority: Major | Status: Closed | Resolution: Fixed\n\nDescription:\nWhen calling SubLine.intersection() with two lines that not intersect, then a NullPointerException is thrown in Line.toSubSpace(). This bug is in the twod and threed implementations.\n\nThe attached patch fixes both implementations and adds the required test cases.\n\nComments:\n\n[Andreas Huber]: This patch fixes both implementations and adds test cases.\n\n[Luc Maisonobe]: Fixed in subversion repository as of r1488866.\nPatch applied with minor whitespace changes.\n\nThanks for the report and for the patch.\n\n[Luc Maisonobe]: Closing all resolved issue now available in released 3.3 version.",
  "fix_diff": "--- org.apache.commons.math3.geometry.euclidean.threed.SubLine (buggy)\n+++ org.apache.commons.math3.geometry.euclidean.threed.SubLine (fixed)\n@@ -111,6 +111,9 @@\n \n         // compute the intersection on infinite line\n         Vector3D v1D = line.intersection(subLine.line);\n+        if (v1D == null) {\n+            return null;\n+        }\n \n         // check location of point with respect to first sub-line\n         Location loc1 = remainingRegion.checkPoint(line.toSubSpace(v1D));\n\n--- org.apache.commons.math3.geometry.euclidean.twod.SubLine (buggy)\n+++ org.apache.commons.math3.geometry.euclidean.twod.SubLine (fixed)\n@@ -115,6 +115,9 @@\n \n         // compute the intersection on infinite line\n         Vector2D v2D = line1.intersection(line2);\n+        if (v2D == null) {\n+            return null;\n+        }\n \n         // check location of point with respect to first sub-line\n         Location loc1 = getRemainingRegion().checkPoint(line1.toSubSpace(v2D));"
}